# Bu dosya GitHub'ın "Cite this repository" kutusunu ve Zenodo arşiv üst verisini besler.
# Sürüm ve tarih her yayın etiketinde (vX.Y.Z) güncellenmeli; sürüm DOI'si Zenodo'dan alınıp identifiers'a eklenir. ORCID eklenmesi önerilir:
#   orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Bu yazılımı kullanırsanız lütfen aşağıdaki gibi atıf yapın. / If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PTCalc: open computational tools for pharmaceutical technology"
abstract: >-
  Open-source web application and .NET library for pharmaceutical technology computations:
  a dissolution-kinetics engine (16 release models, nonlinear least squares in the F(%) domain,
  AIC/AICc/MSC ranking and Akaike weights, Korsmeyer–Peppas F<=60% rule, Hopfenberg geometry
  exponents incl. Karasulu half-sphere and triangle; results compared with DDSolver 1.0 outputs),
  a pseudo-ternary phase-diagram tool with polygon area and centroid calculation (in use since
  2001), f1/f2 similarity factors, dose–response (LD50) and t-test utilities, plus detailed
  bilingual (Turkish/English) guides with verified references. Sites: https://ptcalc.net (English),
  https://ptcalc.tr (Turkish).
